@startuml
title US-005 - Sign in - SSD level 1
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Account Holder" as User
participant "Nexo" as System

note over System
  Email/password scenario; provider interaction is not detailed here.
end note
User -> System: Sign in (email, password)
activate System
alt Request accepted
    System --> User: Session issued; signed in
else Missing required credentials
    System --> User: Validation errors; no session issued
else Credentials not accepted
    System --> User: Generic sign-in error; no session issued
end
deactivate System
@enduml
